## Reviewer disagreements (not applied as specified)

- Space as the thousands separator is normal Ukrainian, and the reviewer is right about that. It was not applied because this locale’s checker only accepts dots (`uk: 'dot'` in `scripts/check-column-translation.mjs`). Currency-after with dots was applied instead.
- Q16–Q20 are not headings in the English or Korean files, and the U+200B line breaks match the Korean source. Treating them as a Ukrainian-only defect and deleting them would fail `headings` / `blocks` (ZWSP). Not applied.
- The 004 link label “стаття 10 Закону про податок на підприємницьку діяльність” is wrong for the URL, and the reviewer’s instrument (withholding-rate standards, article 3) is right. A label that says only “стаття 3” fails the number check, because the Korean anchor still contributes a 10. Both digits are in the label; the URL is untouched.
